WEBVTT

00:09:30.024 --> 00:09:31.775
Now the reality is ...

00:09:32.901 --> 00:09:37.906
that a substantial majority of those jobs
do not require a college degree.

00:09:38.574 --> 00:09:40.492
And so, it serves --

00:09:40.492 --> 00:09:44.455
You talk about structural,
systemic racism.

00:09:45.581 --> 00:09:49.877
What happens is it just knocks out
a large population.

00:09:50.753 --> 00:09:55.215
And the reality is skills-first
is what we should be focused on.

00:09:55.215 --> 00:09:56.425
And I want to be clear:

00:09:56.425 --> 00:10:00.179
I want as many people to go to college
as can go to college.